{"seq":7,"slug":"portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation","title":"投资组合优化与资产配置","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"投资组合优化与资产配置-简介\">投资组合优化与资产配置 简介</h1><p>投资的核心问题从来不是「哪个资产会涨」，而是「在不确定的世界里，应该把钱按什么比例放进哪些资产，并随时间如何调整」。这个 hub 系统讲述如何在风险与收益之间构造、评估并管理一个投资组合——把一组散乱的资产，变成一个有明确风险预算、可解释、可执行的整体。</p>\n<p>为什么这件事值得专门学？因为分散化是投资里少有的「免费午餐」：恰当组合多个不完全相关的资产，能在不牺牲预期收益的前提下显著降低波动。但要真正吃到这顿午餐，需要把直觉翻译成可计算的优化问题，又要清醒地意识到这些模型在真实数据上有多脆弱。组合管理因此是量化金融里理论与工程结合得最紧密的领域之一：数学给出最优解，现实用估计误差、交易成本和人性把它打回原形。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 沿着「理论—修正—决策—落地」四步展开。</p>\n<p>第一章「现代投资组合理论」奠定语言：均值-方差优化、有效前沿与资本资产定价模型，告诉你「最优」在数学上意味着什么；同时正视估计误差与理论边界，理解为什么纸面最优解往往不能直接拿来用。</p>\n<p>第二章「稳健配置方法」回应上一章的脆弱性：Black-Litterman 模型把市场均衡与主观观点融合，风险平价与风险预算换一个角度按风险而非资金分配，协方差收缩与稳健估计则直接修补输入端的噪声。这一章的主题是：与其追求精确的错，不如接受稳健的近似对。</p>\n<p>第三章「配置策略与下注规模」从静态最优走向动态决策：战略配置与战术配置如何分工，凯利准则如何回答「该押多大」这个被低估的问题，因子与 Smart Beta 如何把配置建立在更可解释的收益来源上。</p>\n<p>第四章「实施与组合管理」处理把方案变成持仓后的真实世界：再平衡策略、交易成本与税收、回测及其常见陷阱。再漂亮的配置，若忽略摩擦成本或栽在过拟合的回测上，都会在实盘里失血。</p>\n<p>读完这个 hub，你应有的不只是公式，而是一种判断力：知道每个模型假设了什么、会在哪里失效、以及在风险与收益的权衡中，如何做出既理性又经得起现实考验的配置决策。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modern-portfolio-theory","title":"现代投资组合理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mean-variance-optimization","title":"均值-方差优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/mean-variance-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"efficient-frontier-and-capm","title":"有效前沿与 CAPM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/efficient-frontier-and-capm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"estimation-error-and-limits","title":"估计误差与 MPT 的局限 — Estimation Error and the Limits of MPT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/estimation-error-and-limits"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"robust-allocation-methods","title":"稳健配置方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"black-litterman-model","title":"Black-Litterman 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/black-litterman-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-parity-and-budgeting","title":"风险平价与风险预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/risk-parity-and-budgeting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"shrinkage-and-robust-covariance","title":"收缩估计与稳健协方差","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/shrinkage-and-robust-covariance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"allocation-strategies-and-sizing","title":"配置策略与下注规模","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-vs-tactical-allocation","title":"战略配置与战术配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing/strategic-vs-tactical-allocation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kelly-criterion-and-sizing","title":"凯利准则与仓位规模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing/kelly-criterion-and-sizing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"factor-and-smart-beta-allocation","title":"因子与 Smart Beta 配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/allocation-strategies-and-sizing/factor-and-smart-beta-allocation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"implementation-and-management","title":"实施与组合管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rebalancing-strategies","title":"再平衡策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/rebalancing-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transaction-costs-and-taxes","title":"交易成本与税务：把纸面组合变成真实持仓的摩擦账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/transaction-costs-and-taxes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"backtesting-and-pitfalls","title":"回测与陷阱：为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/backtesting-and-pitfalls"}]}]}